{"ref":"BDB, מִלְכֹּם","hw":"מִלְכֹּם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִלְכֹּם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.div. Milcom</strong>, god of Ammonites <strong>(</strong>cf. RS<sup>Sem i. 67</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ שִׁקֻּץ עַמֹּנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.5\">1 K 11:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עַשְׁתֹּרֶת</span>); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ אֱלֹהֵי בְנֵי עַמּוֹן</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:33\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.33\">33</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּמוֹשׁ</span>), so read also (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹלָךְ</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.7\">7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּמוֹשׁ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ תּוֹעֲבַת בְּנֵי־עַמּוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.13\">2 K 23:13</a> (‖ as <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:33\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.33\">1 K 11:33</a>); <em>id.</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלְכֹּם</span> also for <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.1\">Je 49:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.3\">3</a> (𝔊 Μελχολ, Μελχομ), cf. Gie, and <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:5\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.5\">Zp 1:5</a> (𝔖 𝔙, cf. Now), prob. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.30\">2 S 12:30</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.2\">1 Ch 20:2</a> (v. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֶלֶךְ</span> <strong>5 d</strong>), and perhaps <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:15\" href=\"/Amos.1.15\">Am 1:15</a> (whence <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.3\">Je 49:3</a>; cf. Dr Now;—not We GASm).","next":"BDB, יַמְלֵךְ","prev":"BDB, מַלְכָּם"}